.TH "Docv::CrystalPages::Generator" "3cr" "2026-11-03" "docv 0.1.0" "docv API Reference"
.SH "NAME"
Docv::CrystalPages::Generator \- Writes pages into an output directory.
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.nf
\fBrequire "docv/cli"\fR
.sp
\fBclass Docv::CrystalPages::Generator\fR
.fi
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
.PP
Writes pages into an output directory. A page whose content is
unchanged keeps its file and date; generated pages no longer produced
are removed. A file there that was not generated is never touched.
.SH "CONSTANTS"
.PP
\fBTH_DATE = /\eA\e.TH "[\(ha"]*" "[\(ha"]*" "([\(ha"]*)"/\fR
.SH "CONSTRUCTORS"
.PP
\fBdef self.new(output : String, date : String)\fR
.SH "CLASS METHODS"
.TP 4
\fBdef self.today : String\fR
Today, or the date of \fB\%SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH\fR for reproducible builds.
.SH "INSTANCE METHODS"
.TP 4
\fBdef run(pages : Array(Page)) : Tuple(Int32, Int32, Int32)\fR
Writes \fIpages\fR; returns the numbers of pages written, unchanged and
removed.
.SH "DEFINED IN"
src/docv/crystal_pages/pages.cr
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR "Docv::CrystalPages" (3cr),
.BR "docv" (7cr)
